/* Settings window */

"Configure hibernate here, then close this window. The app stays in the menu bar and keeps your shortcut active."
= "在此配置休眠。关闭这个窗口后，App 会继续留在菜单栏，你的快捷键也照常生效。";

"Background service is running (menu bar + shortcut)"
= "后台服务运行中（菜单栏 + 快捷键）";

"Background service is stopped"
= "后台服务已停止";

"Restart App"
= "重新启动 App";

"Privileged helper installed — hibernate won't ask for your password"
= "特权助手已安装 — 休眠时不会再向你要密码";

"First hibernate will ask for your password once to install the helper"
= "第一次休眠时会要一次密码来安装助手";

"Look for a small moon icon at the top-right of your screen. On MacBooks with a notch, it may be inside the menu bar \"•••\" overflow section — click the arrow at the far right of the menu bar to find it."
= "在屏幕右上角找一个月亮形状的小图标。在有刘海的 MacBook 上，它可能被收进菜单栏的 \"•••\" 溢出区 — 点菜单栏最右边的箭头就能看到。";

"Enable hibernate"
= "启用休眠";

"Restore normal sleep (hibernatemode 3) after wake"
= "唤醒后恢复普通睡眠（hibernatemode 3）";

"Eject external drives before hibernate"
= "休眠前推出外接磁盘";

"Safely ejects USB, Thunderbolt, and SD card volumes before sleeping. Network drives are not affected."
= "进入睡眠前安全推出 USB、雷雳和 SD 卡卷。网络驱动器不受影响。";

"Keep awake on power adapter"
= "接电源时保持唤醒";

"Prevents idle sleep while plugged in (pmset -c sleep 0). Turning off restores a 10-minute AC sleep timer."
= "接通电源时阻止空闲睡眠（pmset -c sleep 0）。关掉后会恢复 10 分钟的电源睡眠计时。";

"Start on login"
= "登录时启动";

"Keyboard shortcut"
= "键盘快捷键";

"Change Shortcut…"
= "更改快捷键…";

"View pmset in Terminal"
= "在终端中查看 pmset";

"Stop Background Service"
= "停止后台服务";

"Quit App"
= "退出 App";

"Hibernate Now"
= "立即休眠";

"Quit the app before moving it to Applications."
= "把它移到「应用程序」之前，请先退出 App。";

